<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Don’t complain when you have a job to do.</l><l>Make your bed and do some dusting in your room.</l><l>Do your job joyfully, show responsibility.</l><l>Don’t complain when you have a job to do.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Don’t complain when you have a job to do.</l><l>Set the table, clean the dishes, mop the floor,</l><l>Take the garbage, feed the dog, pick the toys, mow the lawn.</l><l>Help to fold the laundry too.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
